  <article class="legal-copy section-frame"><p class="eyebrow">Policy version 1 draft</p><h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1><p class="lede">Necessary storage keeps Infinite Ocean secure and makes signup and checkout work. Optional analytics is first-party, content-free and off until you accept it.</p><h2>What analytics never contains</h2><p>No name, email, User or Account ID, payment details, prompt, answer, document, evidence, task content, full URL, query string or referrer enters a launch analytics event.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can accept or reject optional analytics without changing access to the site or Spyglass. The preference panel appears when no decision exists; after launch it will remain available from this page and the private application.</p><h2>Retention and erasure</h2><p>Raw events are retained for 395 days by default and deleted in bounded batches. Erasing this browser's privacy data removes its consent receipts and raw analytics sooner. Account, billing and Affiliate records follow separate contractual and legal rules.</p><h2>Before production</h2><p>The controller identity, privacy contact, complete processor and international-transfer list, legal bases and jurisdiction-specific retention periods will be published here after release-owner and legal review. This construction copy does not pretend those open facts are settled.</p></article>
